From 4da06f31d4272cde83187ddd0c8be1a6b3d33729 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WLS Dev <dev@wls.local>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 06:29:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test: add vitest suite (57 tests) for utils, validation,
 saveSystem, quests, achievements

- vitest.config.ts + npm test / test:watch scripts
- src/game/testHelpers.ts: makeCharacter/makeGameState factories
- src/__tests__: utils, validation, saveSystem (localStorage mock), quests+achievements
- CI: run tests in workflow; integrity check includes test files
- deploy.yml: GitHub Pages workflow (--base /WLS/)
- README: testing section
